{"id":"7ca8cc0c3bb0f523","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-tree8-derived-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Derived Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree8-derived-tree — ZFC Tree8 Derived Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-derived-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-derived-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-derived-tree — ZFC Tree8 Derived Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-derived-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-derived-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-derived-tree — ZFC Tree8 Derived Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,T,s,t,u\\in V\">\\(D,T,s,t,u\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\">\\(\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\)</span> (locally quantified extension-order witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (tree-order predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8DerivedTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8DerivedTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}derived\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8DerivedTree}_S(D,T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\sqsubseteq_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\\land D=\\{s\\in T:\\exists t,u\\in T\\;(s\\sqsubseteq_T t\\land s\\sqsubseteq_T u\\land\\neg(t\\sqsubseteq_T u\\lor u\\sqsubseteq_T t))\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}derived\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8DerivedTree}_S(D,T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\sqsubseteq_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\\land D=\\{s\\in T:\\exists t,u\\in T\\;(s\\sqsubseteq_T t\\land s\\sqsubseteq_T u\\land\\neg(t\\sqsubseteq_T u\\lor u\\sqsubseteq_T t))\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The derivative keeps exactly the nodes having two incompatible extensions in the canonical extension order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,T,s,t,u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8DerivedTree}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}derived\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8DerivedTree}_S(D,T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\sqsubseteq_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\sqsubseteq_T=\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\times T:s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\sqsubseteq_T)\\land D=\\{s\\in T:\\exists t,u\\in T\\;(s\\sqsubseteq_T t\\land s\\sqsubseteq_T u\\land\\neg(t\\sqsubseteq_T u\\lor u\\sqsubseteq_T t))\\}\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1118,"backlinks":[{"id":"b8da74056d30711b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8DerivedTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree10DerivativeOfTree}_S\\subseteq V^2$（见 [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-tree8-derived-tree.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3809","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-tree8-derived-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree8-derived-tree]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78"]}